    {
      "id": "11-BOSS-OPT-02",
      "goal": "隱藏盒體並新增 32 邊圓柱",
      "context": "確定 Object Mode 且 Body_Reference 已選取；本示範 Unit Scale 為 0.001，Blender 版本為 5.2.1 LTS。",
      "operation": [
        "滑鼠移至 3D View，按 H 隱藏已選盒體。",
        "按 F3，搜尋 Add Cylinder，按 Enter。"
      ],
      "success": "Outliner 的活動物件變成 Cylinder；數位尺寸約 2000 × 2000 × 2000 mm，原盒只是隱藏。",
      "readings": [
        {
          "location": "Blender 3D View 側欄 Item → Dimensions；數值由 Blender 程式讀回",
          "value": "1999.999878 × 1999.999878 × 1999.999878 mm",
          "source": "safe-summary.records[1].observed.dims"
        }
      ],
      "limits": [
        "若預設圓柱尺寸、邊數、單位或場景設定不同，停止並先確認，不可直接套用下一步的縮放倍率。"
      ],
      "screenshot": {
        "relativePath": "learning/evidence/08/2026-10-28-manual-boss-gui-trial-v003/08-BOSS-GUI-02-cylinder.png",
        "sha256": "4c02696e52d95101011263292ac24e310f1004654d3dec1e1eeb87be5a1e79ee",
        "capture": "isolated Blender original screenshot"
